<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Visit window (ADR-045, form A): the visit's non-modal work window.
  Loaded by gui/widgets/visits_panel.py through gui/ui_loader.py.

  Redesign (2026-10-16): one night, one page. The head reads the date (fixed:
  it is changed from the "..." menu) and edits the NAME in place. The kind's
  analysis action is the hero button. The visit's products (runs, reports,
  charts, measured points) are the RESULTS list; the raw frames of the night
  live in a FOLDED block below, with their count. The per-kind blocks are
  fragments (ui/visit_measurements.ui, ui/visit_mpc_block.ui) loaded only when
  the kind calls for them: absent means absent, as the pinned tests demand.
  The PassiveList wheel guards are custom widgets inserted into the
  placeholders in code (ADR-005).
-->
